# PROFILE_GRAPH ownership

When adding a top-level profile authoring field:

1. Add it to `PROFILE_FIELDS` in `src/kernel/schema.ts`.
2. Own it in `PROFILE_GRAPH` (`src/kernel/profile-graph.ts`) — section facet or `ownsFields`.
3. Do **not** tell agents to invent a `FacetKind` in theoremai-frontend.

Drift is gated by `tests/kernel/profile-graph.test.ts`.

Studio UI, compile, and run must project this catalog. Free-tier policy stays in the frontend `studio-policy.ts` only.
